{"id":"fd664f5e3b6d342a","group":"43","path":"43/43-df-ce-set-entropy.md","title":"c.e. 集的枚举概率熵与最短索引复杂度","display":"df-ce-set-entropy — c.e. 集的枚举概率熵与最短索引复杂度","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Algorithmic Randomness and Complexity","book_abbrev":"43","label":"43-df-ce-set-entropy","aliases":["43-df-ce-set-entropy"],"display":"df-ce-set-entropy — c.e. 集的枚举概率熵与最短索引复杂度","depends_on":["[[43-df-enumeration-probability]]","[[43-df-ce]]","[[43-df-prefixkolm]]"],"source_edition":"Downey–Hirschfeldt, draft 2007-07-28; supplied PDF, 629 pages","source_location":"Definition 19.2.2","source_printed_pages":"572","source_pdf_pages":"592","source_scope":"book","verification_status":"source-statement-checked","source_statement_checked":true,"source_proof_checked":false,"eligible_as_verified_dependency":true,"revision_round":"2026-10-16-expansion"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Algorithmic Randomness and Complexity"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"43"},{"key":"label","html":"43-df-ce-set-entropy"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>43-df-ce-set-entropy</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-ce-set-entropy — c.e. 集的枚举概率熵与最短索引复杂度"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"adec8e1737933ff1\" href=\"?note=adec8e1737933ff1\" title=\"43-df-enumeration-probability\">43-df-enumeration-probability</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"6c0559518cd32104\" href=\"?note=6c0559518cd32104\" title=\"43-df-ce\">43-df-ce</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"6cd902d852c2c848\" href=\"?note=6cd902d852c2c848\" title=\"43-df-prefixkolm\">43-df-prefixkolm</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_edition","html":"Downey–Hirschfeldt, draft 2007-07-28; supplied PDF, 629 pages"},{"key":"source_location","html":"Definition 19.2.2"},{"key":"source_printed_pages","html":"572"},{"key":"source_pdf_pages","html":"592"},{"key":"source_scope","html":"book"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"source-statement-checked"},{"key":"source_statement_checked","html":"true"},{"key":"source_proof_checked","html":"false"},{"key":"eligible_as_verified_dependency","html":"true"},{"key":"revision_round","html":"2026-10-16-expansion"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p>固定 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"e\\in\\mathbb N\">\\(e\\in\\mathbb N\\)</span> 满足 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"adec8e1737933ff1\" href=\"?note=adec8e1737933ff1\" title=\"43-df-enumeration-probability\">43-df-enumeration-probability</a> 的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{UniversalEnumerationIndex}(e)\">\\(\\operatorname{UniversalEnumerationIndex}(e)\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"P_e(A)\">\\(P_e(A)\\)</span> 见该原子。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"W_j\">\\(W_j\\)</span> 采用 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"6c0559518cd32104\" href=\"?note=6c0559518cd32104\" title=\"43-df-ce\">43-df-ce</a> 的同一个标准枚举，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"K(j)\">\\(K(j)\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"6cd902d852c2c848\" href=\"?note=6cd902d852c2c848\" title=\"43-df-prefixkolm\">43-df-prefixkolm</a>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\\subseteq\\mathbb N\">\\(A\\subseteq\\mathbb N\\)</span> 满足 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{CE}(A)\">\\(\\operatorname{CE}(A)\\)</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"P_e(A)&gt;0\">\\(P_e(A)&gt;0\\)</span>；这保证下式两个值均为自然数。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"H_e(A)\\coloneqq\\left\\lceil-\\log_2P_e(A)\\right\\rceil.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[H_e(A)\\coloneqq\\left\\lceil-\\log_2P_e(A)\\right\\rceil.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"I(A)\\coloneqq\\min\\{K(j):j\\in\\mathbb N\\land W_j=A\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[I(A)\\coloneqq\\min\\{K(j):j\\in\\mathbb N\\land W_j=A\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>书中 H(j) 指自然数 j 的前缀复杂度，本目录统一写 K(j)，因此最短索引复杂度 I 与概率熵 H_e 不混用。固定 e 后才可省略下标；这里始终保留 e，以免不同 universal enumeration 的常数被隐藏。</p>\n<p>来源：所供 2007-07-28 草稿，Definition 19.2.2，印刷页 572，PDF 页 592。本轮逐项核对陈述；未把来源完整证明或机器形式化标为已核验。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"43-df-enumeration-probability","status":"resolved","id":"adec8e1737933ff1","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[43-df-enumeration-probability]]","embed":false},{"target":"43-df-ce","status":"resolved","id":"6c0559518cd32104","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[43-df-ce]]","embed":false},{"target":"43-df-prefixkolm","status":"resolved","id":"6cd902d852c2c848","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[43-df-prefixkolm]]","embed":false},{"target":"43-df-enumeration-probability","status":"resolved","id":"adec8e1737933ff1","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"固定 $e\\in\\mathbb N$ 满足 [[43-df-enumeration-probability]] 的 $\\operatorname{UniversalEnumerationIndex}(e)$；$P_e(A)$ 见该原子。$W_j$ 采用 [[43-df-ce]] 的同一个标准枚举，$K(j)$ 见 [[43-df-prefixkolm]]。$A\\subseteq\\mathbb N$ 满足 $\\operatorname{CE}(A)$ 且 $P_e(A)>0$；这保证下式两个值均为自然数。","embed":false},{"target":"43-df-ce","status":"resolved","id":"6c0559518cd32104","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"固定 $e\\in\\mathbb N$ 满足 [[43-df-enumeration-probability]] 的 $\\operatorname{UniversalEnumerationIndex}(e)$；$P_e(A)$ 见该原子。$W_j$ 采用 [[43-df-ce]] 的同一个标准枚举，$K(j)$ 见 [[43-df-prefixkolm]]。$A\\subseteq\\mathbb N$ 满足 $\\operatorname{CE}(A)$ 且 $P_e(A)>0$；这保证下式两个值均为自然数。","embed":false},{"target":"43-df-prefixkolm","status":"resolved","id":"6cd902d852c2c848","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"固定 $e\\in\\mathbb N$ 满足 [[43-df-enumeration-probability]] 的 $\\operatorname{UniversalEnumerationIndex}(e)$；$P_e(A)$ 见该原子。$W_j$ 采用 [[43-df-ce]] 的同一个标准枚举，$K(j)$ 见 [[43-df-prefixkolm]]。$A\\subseteq\\mathbb N$ 满足 $\\operatorname{CE}(A)$ 且 $P_e(A)>0$；这保证下式两个值均为自然数。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"e\\in\\mathbb N","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{UniversalEnumerationIndex}(e)","display":false},{"tex":"P_e(A)","display":false},{"tex":"W_j","display":false},{"tex":"K(j)","display":false},{"tex":"A\\subseteq\\mathbb N","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{CE}(A)","display":false},{"tex":"P_e(A)>0","display":false},{"tex":"H_e(A)\\coloneqq\\left\\lceil-\\log_2P_e(A)\\right\\rceil.","display":true},{"tex":"I(A)\\coloneqq\\min\\{K(j):j\\in\\mathbb N\\land W_j=A\\}.","display":true}],"bytes":1684,"backlinks":[{"id":"f5b5175508d7a1c1","anchor":"ref-481","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[43-df-ce-set-entropy]] — c.e. 集的枚举概率熵与最短索引复杂度"},{"id":"b185b18d3dbf7e61","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"固定 $e\\in\\mathbb N$ 为 [[43-df-ce-set-entropy]] 中的通用枚举索引，$H_e,I$ 采用该原子；$\\operatorname{CE}$、$K$ 见 [[43-df-ce]]、[[43-df-prefixkolm]]。所有量化的 A 均为自然数集合；$H_e(A)$ 仅在 $P_e(A)>0$ 时使用。常数可依赖于固定 e 与复杂度机器，但不依赖 A。"}],"outgoing":["adec8e1737933ff1","6c0559518cd32104","6cd902d852c2c848"]}